sub:assertion {
    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/claim/morphoeval-karbowski-cortical-sulcal-axon-tension> pk:hasAssessment <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-karbowski-cortical-sulcal-axon-tension-overall> .
    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-karbowski-cortical-sulcal-axon-tension-overall> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
        rdfs:label "Van Essen (1997), Hilgetag & Barbas (2006) & Mota & Herculano-Houzel (2015) cortico-cortical axonal tension and cortical folding — MorphoEval overall 93.3/100" ;
        dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
        dct:description "Pass 2 (v2) evaluation of `2020-karbowski-cortical-sulcal-axon-tension.py` (overall weighted score: 93.4/100, up from 55.8/100 in v1). The remediated script relaxes a coupled 2D coronal elastoplastic cortical ribbon and viscoelastic cortico-cortical white-matter axonal tension network across connectivity matrix C_ij with towed-axon growth via L-BFGS-B energy minimization; reproduces Hilgetag & Barbas's (2006) gyral-vs-sulcal laminar thickness dichotomy (h_gyrus / h_fundus = 1.6154 vs ref 1.6186); validates Mota & Herculano-Houzel's (2015) 12-species universal cortical folding scaling law A_T * sqrt(h) = k * A_E^(5/4) (slope alpha = 1.2567 ± 0.0038, r = 0.9999); verifies axonal tension ablation / callosotomy (k_a = 0) and lissencephalic (GI = 1.0000) controls; and segments the SHA-256-locked coronal human cerebral hemisphere specimen (`coronal_cortex_axon_tracts_specimen.jpg`, 52 sulcal fundi, GI = 2.8115, h_gyrus/h_fundus = 1.5793). Overall 93.3/100 (faithfulness 93.0, reproducibility 93.9); rubric morphoeval 0.1.0; checkpoint commit 8871db0; environment: python 3.14.7, numpy 2.4.2, scipy 1.17.0, matplotlib 3.10.8, Pillow 12.1.1. Dimension assessments: Model fidelity to source 94, Morphological realism / specimen match 92, Parameter expressivity 92, Morphometric validation 94, Source and data traceability 95, Code-to-model traceability 94, Reproducibility package 93. Output judged: docs/media/cortical_sulcal_axon_tension_comparison.png: rendered output of 2020-karbowski-cortical-sulcal-axon-tension.py at 8871db0, image/png, 878251 B, 2096×1419 px, artifact_sha256 9f110bc763cffc5cb708f6d89ace1d784b09467af21328f9b8cee0f42d8db6fd (sha256 9f110bc763cffc5cb708f6d89ace1d784b09467af21328f9b8cee0f42d8db6fd), spec_fingerprint 84c495a5d45894646a6161c31d7690d7bf05b858d5926075a0791c491fd2603b. Dual provenance: spec_fingerprint: 84c495a5d45894646a6161c31d7690d7bf05b858d5926075a0791c491fd2603b; artifact_sha256: 9f110bc763cffc5cb708f6d89ace1d784b09467af21328f9b8cee0f42d8db6fd; input_dataset_sha256: {datasets/cortical_sulcal_axon_tension/coronal_cortex_axon_tracts_specimen.jpg=ff9a25e993fd5aad..., datasets/cortical_sulcal_axon_tension/cortical_sulcal_axon_tension_reference.json=51d4ed1c896638d9..., datasets/cortical_sulcal_axon_tension/paper_citations.bib=bcd7b0529c1c497d..., datasets/cortical_sulcal_axon_tension/scout_manifest.json=3ef66e67c6994708...}. Supersedes audit: 2026-10-19-cortical-sulcal-axon-tension-audit." ;
        dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-rubric-0.1.0> ;
        pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
        pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/overall" ;
        pk:evidenceAgainst "remediation needed: Couple the 2D coronal viscoelastic cortico-cortical axonal tension network to diffusion-tensor tractography (DTI) connectome matrices from macaque and human fetal brains to resolve 3D sulcal pit emergence along primary association tracts." ;
        pk:hasScore "0.933"^^xsd:double ;
        pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .
    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> a pk:Model ;
        rdfs:label "Gemini 4 Argon (MorphoEval Autonomous Loop Slot 090 Pass 2 Assessor)" ;
        dct:identifier "gemini-4-argon" ;
        prov:actedOnBehalfOf <https://orcid.org/0009-0007-4948-9192> ;
        foaf:homepage <https://deepmind.google> .
}

